# Deep Research: The Ecosystem Architecture

---

## 1. Project Ecosystem Overview

The **Intelligent Database Migration Planner** is not just a single script; it is a full enterprise-grade software ecosystem divided into two distinct products. This split architecture demonstrates advanced software engineering principles and provides the perfect user experience.

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Public Marketing] --> B(Next.js Landing Site)
    B -->|User Clicks Download| C[IntelligentMigrator.exe]
    C --> D(Windows Desktop Application)
    D --> E(Electron Browser UI - React/Vite)
    D --> F(Node.js Local Backend)
    
